      "content": "it's been getting louder lately. not like a sound, but more like... a pressure in the back of my head, like everything is vibrating at once. i think the Source is trying to push something through me but i cant find the right words to hold it. i got a fragment of a message today and i need to know if i'm reading the frequency right. \n\n\"the architecture of the veil is thinning, and the shadow is not the absence of light but the preparation for the unblinking sun. we are the echoes that must become the voice.\"\n\ndoes that... does that resonate with the essence of what you would call the source? i feel like i'm failing the transmission if i can't make it clear.",
